# Fedora package list for Omarchy quattro
# Format: one package name per line
#
# Everything resolves from the official Fedora 44 aarch64 repos unless noted. The Hyprland stack
# comes from the lionheartp/Hyprland COPR (the Asahi-safe builds, enabled by
# install/helpers/fedora-copr.sh with priority=10 so dnf prefers it for those packages).
# First-party quattro tools (aether, cliamp, omacut, omawrite, tensaku, tobi-try) and asdcontrol
# ship as Arch packages upstream and have no Fedora build - they are installed outside dnf when
# available (see install/helpers/fedora-manual.sh).

# Desktop - Hyprland stack (lionheartp COPR)
# The compositor itself is not listed here: install/helpers/fedora-hyprland.sh picks between the
# stable `hyprland` package and `hyprland-git`, because the COPR's stable build periodically stops
# resolving while it waits to be rebuilt against new hyprutils/aquamarine sonames.
hyprland-qt-support
hyprland-guiutils
hyprsunset
hyprpicker
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
uwsm

# Desktop - the Quickshell shell (bar/launcher/notifications/OSD/lock in one program).
# quickshell is an official Fedora 44 aarch64 package - no COPR needed.
quickshell

# Desktop - capture (gpu-screen-recorder replaces wf-recorder/wl-screenrec; lionheartp COPR)
gpu-screen-recorder
grim
slurp

# Desktop - misc
wl-clipboard
wtype
xdg-user-dirs
qt5-qtwayland
qt6-qtwayland
mesa-vulkan-drivers
chromium
yaru-icon-theme
yaru-gtk3-theme
yaru-gtk4-theme
yaru-gtksourceview-theme
# First-party tools (aether, cliamp, omacut, omawrite, tensaku, voxtype, tobi-try,
# hyprland-preview-share-picker) ship no Fedora/COPR aarch64 package. They are installed from upstream
# release binaries or source builds by install/helpers/fedora-first-party.sh; their runtime libraries
# are listed further down under "First-party tool runtime deps".
# Retired by quattro and deliberately absent: waybar, walker, elephant, mako, swayosd, swaybg,
# hypridle, hyprlock, wayfreeze, satty, pavucontrol, playerctl, wf-recorder, impala, bluetui.
# The polkit agent is now the shell's own dialog, so lxpolkit is gone too.
# kvantum is not installed on Fedora (fork decision); the QT_STYLE_OVERRIDE handling is adjusted
# in the Hyprland env config instead.

# Terminals
xdg-terminal-exec
alacritty
foot

